# MkDocs docs site builds to target/docs-site (covered by the target/ ignore above)
# Local docs toolchain venv (Homebrew python is PEP 668 externally-managed, so pip needs a venv):
#   python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r docs-requirements.txt
.venv/

# JetBrains Junie local agent state
.junie/
!.junie/guidelines.md

